OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FQuite windy
OL,6,Fwith scattered showers at first. Winds
OL,7,Fcontinuing to ease through the evening
OL,8,Fand overnight and becoming mostly dry
OL,9,Fwith just the odd light shower around.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FMostly dry and with some
OL,12,Fbrightness to start. Cloud and rain
OL,13,Fspread north through the morning.
OL,14,FStaying wet and windy through the
OL,15,Fafternoon and evening and becoming
OL,16,Fincreasingly windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
