OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FVery
OL,6,Fwindy Tuesday with showers, some
OL,7,Fheavy. Winds easing overnight into
OL,8,FWednesday, then bright spells and
OL,9,Fscattered showers. Mostly dry Thursday
OL,10,Fwith variable cloud and bright spells,
OL,11,Ffreshening winds later.
